# gpu-memory-watch
owner: local-inference-monitor · cadence: hourly · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that watches GPU memory on your Mac and remote box every hour and warns you before a stray process eats 16 GB again?**

## Prompt
List GPU memory usage per process on the Mac and remote box; if any single process exceeds a safe threshold (e.g. a Flash Next process taking 16 GB on GPU 1), recommend which PID to free before it forces an OOM restart.

## Evidence
> There's still a Flash Next server (PID 1069592) eating 16 GB on GPU 1.
